[I] Three anti-aliased oscillators plugin

[T] This plugin contains three anti-aliased oscillators, all based on the
[T] concept of using precomputed bandlimited Dirac pulses to construct the
[T] classical waveforms.

[U] https://kokkinizita.linuxaudio.org/linuxaudio/

[A] Kokkini Zita
[M] René Rebe <rene@exactco.de>

[C] extra/multimedia
[F] CROSS

[L] GPL3
[V] 0.3.0

[D] 577553d5089f7080dad51735e9bf4d0c55d90689f3ae5cdb01b5416f VCO-plugins-0.3.0.tar.bz2 https://kokkinizita.linuxaudio.org/linuxaudio/downloads/

ladspa_makefile() {
	# link with the (cross) compiler and install into the target root
	sed -i -e 's/^\tg++ -shared/\t$(CXX) -shared/' \
	       -e 's,/usr/lib/ladspa,$(DESTDIR)'$libdir'/ladspa,' Makefile
	mkdir -p $root$libdir/ladspa
}
hook_add premake 5 ladspa_makefile
